# 🧭 2026 Data & AI Learning Roadmap

**Goal:** Transition from Business Intelligence (Power BI) to Machine Learning (AWS ML Engineer) while building a professional analytics portfolio on GitHub and LinkedIn.

---

## 🧩 Quarter 1 (Jan – Mar 2026): Foundation & Power BI Focus  
**Theme:** Strengthen SQL + start Power BI, establish portfolio structure.

| **Month** | **Focus** | **Actions** | **Deliverables** |
|------------|------------|--------------|------------------|
| **January** | Roadmap kickoff | • Set up GitHub repo folders (SQL, PowerBI, AI) <br> • Audit existing SQL/SSRS work for reusable examples <br> • Identify 2 finance-relevant datasets (Kaggle, data.gov.je, FRED) | ✅ Portfolio skeleton on GitHub <br> ✅ Dataset shortlist |
| **February** | Power BI fundamentals | • Start *Microsoft Power BI Data Analyst (PL-300)* on Microsoft Learn <br> • Re-build one SSRS report in Power BI <br> • Learn Power Query + DAX basics | ✅ Mini-project #1 “Finance KPI Dashboard” |
| **March** | Data storytelling | • Add slicers, drill-throughs, visuals <br> • Connect dashboard to SQL Server <br> • Post LinkedIn article: “Transforming MI Reports into Interactive Dashboards” | ✅ Publish Power BI project #1 <br> ✅ LinkedIn post #1 |

---

## 🤖 Quarter 2 (Apr – Jun 2026): Advanced Analytics + Power BI Certification  
**Theme:** Deeper BI + start predictive analysis introduction.

| **Month** | **Focus** | **Actions** | **Deliverables** |
|------------|------------|--------------|------------------|
| **April** | Advanced Power BI | • Complete Power BI (PL-300) certification prep <br> • Study DAX patterns, relationships, row-level security <br> • Build interactive *Financial Performance Dashboard* | ✅ Power BI project #2 |
| **May** | Exam + automation | • Sit Power BI PL-300 exam <br> • Learn Power Automate basics for scheduled refreshes <br> • Begin light Python data-analysis review (Pandas, NumPy) | 🏆 Power BI certification obtained |
| **June** | Portfolio polish | • Write GitHub READMEs for Power BI projects <br> • Create project summaries (*problem → approach → insight*) <br> • LinkedIn post #2: “Visualising Financial Insights with Power BI” | ✅ Completed BI portfolio section |

---

## ⚙️ Quarter 3 (Jul – Sep 2026): AWS Machine Learning Engineer – Associate (MLA-C01)  
**Theme:** Transition from BI → AI; build first ML project.

| **Month** | **Focus** | **Actions** | **Deliverables** |
|------------|------------|--------------|------------------|
| **July** | AWS basics + ML foundations | • Set up AWS Free Tier <br> • Study *AWS ML Essentials* <br> • Train sample linear model in SageMaker | ✅ Mini-project #1 “Hello SageMaker” |
| **August** | Data engineering (ETL) | • Learn AWS Glue + Athena <br> • Clean public finance dataset (e.g., loan default) <br> • Engineer features with Pandas / Data Wrangler | ✅ Project Part 1 “Finance Data Pipeline on AWS” |
| **September** | Model training & evaluation | • Build credit-risk classification model in SageMaker (XGBoost) <br> • Evaluate F1 & ROC-AUC <br> • Tune hyperparameters | ✅ Project Part 2 “Credit Risk Model” <br> ✅ LinkedIn post #3 |

---

## 🧠 Quarter 4 (Oct – Dec 2026): Deployment, Governance & Certification  
**Theme:** Cloud deployment + exam prep + career visibility.

| **Month** | **Focus** | **Actions** | **Deliverables** |
|------------|------------|--------------|------------------|
| **October** | Deployment & integration | • Deploy model via SageMaker Endpoint + API Gateway <br> • Pull predictions into Power BI | ✅ Capstone v1 “AI-Enhanced Finance Dashboard” |
| **November** | Security & ethics | • Study IAM, encryption, AWS Clarify (bias) <br> • Update project docs with governance section <br> • Practice exam #1 | ✅ Capstone v2 + GitHub final update |
| **December** | Exam prep + career launch | • Practice exam #2 + flashcards <br> • Sit AWS ML Engineer exam <br> • Publish LinkedIn post #4: “Bringing AI to Financial Analytics” <br> • Compile *2026 Year-in-Review* portfolio PDF | 🏆 AWS ML Engineer certification <br> ✅ Final portfolio release |

---

## 🪜 Deliverables by End of 2026

| **Category** | **Output** |
|---------------|------------|
| **Certifications** | ✅ Power BI Data Analyst (PL-300) <br> ✅ AWS Machine Learning Engineer – Associate |
| **Portfolio Projects (GitHub)** | 1️⃣ Finance KPI Dashboard <br> 2️⃣ Financial Performance Dashboard <br> 3️⃣ Finance Data Pipeline on AWS <br> 4️⃣ AI-Enhanced Finance Dashboard |
| **LinkedIn Posts** | 4 well-timed posts showing learning journey + insights |
| **GitHub Enhancements** | Modernized layout <br> README structure for each project <br> Live Power BI report links/screenshots |

