## 🧭 Skills Progression Map

| **Phase** | **Key Skills Gained** |
|------------|-----------------------|
| **Q1 – Q2** | Power BI, DAX, SQL Server integration, storytelling |
| **Q3** | AWS SageMaker, Glue, ETL, model training |
| **Q4** | MLOps, deployment, responsible AI, cloud governance |
| **Continuous** | GitHub documentation, LinkedIn branding, network growth |

